[
  {"comment": "Reorient Design and the pieces of split faces (mitcad#537): a 60 x 40 x 20 block (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2) with a 10 mm pocket cut 25 deep into its front (Sketch2 F3, Extrude2 F4), which splits the front face in two: #0 at x 0..25 and #1 at x 35..60, numbered in a geometric order. Fillet1 (F5) rounds the top edge of #1. A turn that changes which piece comes first renumbers them: the fillet then names the other piece's edge unless the rewrite renames it; the command refuses a turn that leaves a body elsewhere, so each turn taken here turned the fillet with the block."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F3", "corner": [25, -5], "width": 10, "height": 25},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F2.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0",
    "edges": ["E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])#1}"], "radius": 3}},
  {"cmd": "rename_body", "uid": "F2.b0", "name": "Block"},
  {"expect": {"body": "Block", "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [60, 40, 20]},
    "has_face": "F5:fillet(E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])#1})"}},

  {"comment": "180 degrees about Z: the piece at x 35..60 goes to x -60..-35 and comes first, #0."},
  {"cmd": "reorient_design", "axis": "z", "degrees": 180},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Block", "bbox": {"min": [-60, -40, 0], "max": [0, 0, 20]},
    "has_face": "F5:fillet(E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])#0})"}},

  {"comment": "Turned again, as an already turned design: back to #1."},
  {"cmd": "reorient_design", "axis": "z", "degrees": 180},
  {"expect": {"body": "Block", "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [60, 40, 20]},
    "has_face": "F5:fillet(E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])#1})"}},

  {"comment": "270 degrees about X keeps their order (x), then 90 about Z too (x the same, y in order); 270 about Z after it reverses them."},
  {"cmd": "reorient_design", "axis": "x", "degrees": 270},
  {"expect": {"body": "Block", "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, -40], "max": [60, 20, 0]},
    "has_face": "F5:fillet(E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])#1})"}},
  {"cmd": "reorient_design", "axis": "z", "degrees": 90},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Block", "bbox": {"min": [-20, 0, -40], "max": [0, 60, 0]},
    "has_face": "F5:fillet(E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])#1})"}},
  {"cmd": "undo"},
  {"cmd": "reorient_design", "axis": "z", "degrees": 270},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Block", "bbox": {"min": [0, -60, -40], "max": [20, 0, 0]},
    "has_face": "F5:fillet(E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])#0})"}}
]
